# DOI links resolve correctly in browsers but doi.org returns HTTP 403 to
# automated link checkers (bot protection), causing false-positive failures.
# The DOI itself is valid and stable.
https://doi\.org/
# Sibling ToxMCP repos that are still private return 404 to the link
